  "title": "ESS Highlights Third-Party Utility Validating Iron Flow Battery Technology",
  "summary": "ESS Tech, Inc. (NYSE: GWH) (\"ESS\" or the \"Company\"), a leading manufacturer of long-duration iron flow energy storage systems (“LDES”) for commercial and utility-scale applications, highlighted the findings of a final report issued in connection with Burbank Water and Power for the American Public Power Association (APPA) to evaluate the application of ESS’ Iron Flow Battery technology in a real-world utility environment.",
